{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2022-08-31 22:22:00', 'title': 'HOPE GAS ACQUISITION BY HEARTHSTONE CLOSED TODAY', 'text': "CLARKSBURG, W.VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #HOPEGASISBACK--HEARTHSTONE HOLDINGS, INC. (“HEARTHSTONE”), A PORTFOLIO COMPANY OF ULLICO INFRASTRUCTURE FUND (“UIF”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT CLOSED ON ITS ACQUISITION OF 100% OF THE EQUITY INTERESTS IN HOPE GAS, INC. (“HOPE GAS”), A REGULATED GAS DISTRIBUTION COMPANY LOCATED IN WEST VIRGINIA. HEARTHSTONE INDIRECTLY ACQUIRED HOPE GAS FROM DOMINION ENERGY, INC. (“DOMINION ENERGY”). “I'M PLEASED HEARTHSTONE IS INVESTING IN WEST VIRGINIA AND IS COMMITTED TO BRINGING NOT ONLY AF"}